Create or update a Linear document. If `id` is provided, updates the existing document; otherwise creates a new one. When creating, `title` is required and exactly one parent (`project`, `issue`, `initiative`, `cycle`, or `team`) must be specified. On update, passing a parent reparents the document. This tool is part of plugin `Linear`.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
